    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/eco-renewable-energy/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Solar Energy Theme is a specialised solution designed for renewable energy companies, solar energy providers, wind energy firms, hydropower businesses, geothermal energy enterprises, and eco-friendly organisations aiming to promote clean energy solutions. Ideal for showcasing solar panel installation, solar energy systems, off-grid energy solutions, energy-efficient technologies, sustainable power projects, and green energy innovations, this theme features a sleek, modern, and fully responsive design that ensures seamless performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. With customizable sections for project showcases, service highlights, team profiles, and testimonials, it provides abundant branding and layout options to present your renewable energy services professionally. Built with SEO-friendly coding and integrated with the Contact Form 7 plugin for easy client inquiries, the theme helps attract potential customers, investors, and partners. Whether highlighting solar farms, solar rooftop solutions, or eco-friendly energy initiatives, the Solar Energy Theme enables businesses to communicate their commitment to sustainability, engage environmentally conscious audiences, and establish a credible online presence in the renewable energy sector."
    },
